<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.50 higher  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.50 higher  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50 higher. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA US  1-3    220-260 lbs    57.00</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    56.00-56.50</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 47.00. US 1-3     350-500 lbs    45.50 to mostly 46.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     500-650 lbs opened 47.00</p>
</text>
